    [Doc][Misc]Clarify Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B deployment guide (#19900)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Clarifies the Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B deployment guide to make its examples
    easier to follow:
    
    - Uses TiB consistently for the model weight sizes.
    - Explains how to check startup logs while weights load and graphs are
    captured.
    - Uses the configured `SERVICE_PORT` in API and benchmark examples.
    - Shows how to set `reasoning_effort` in a Chat Completions request.
    - Corrects the topology recorded with benchmark results from TP/PP/EP to
    TP/DP/EP.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This PR changes documentation only; no release note fragment is
    needed.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - `format.sh ci`: all hooks passed. Temporary Windows compatibility
    adjustments used to run the checks were restored and are not part of
    this PR.
    - `git diff --check`: passed.
    - No runtime tests were added or run because this PR changes
    documentation only.
    
